talked offline. for list-type: map, a null object and an object missing the key attribute should be equivalent for that key. an object with the key attribute explicitly set to null is distinct


```
list-type: map
list-map-keys: [foo]

[
    null,       --> {foo:undefined}
    {},         --> {foo:undefined}
    {foo:null}  --> {foo:null}
]
```
